The user wants me to build Page 2: Real-Time Monitor. Let me review the specifications from the blueprint document to understand what needs to be built.

From the blueprint, Page 2 is:

Page 2: REAL-TIME MONITOR
Purpose: Live feed of all platform activity — transactions, logins, fraud alerts, system events
Key sections:

Section 2.1: Live Transaction Stream (Auto-Refresh 2s) - Real-time transaction table with fraud scores, color-coded, filters
Section 2.2: Live Metrics Sidebar (Refresh 5s) - Metrics like transactions/min, active sessions, failed logins, etc.
Section 2.3: Geographic Heatmap - Interactive Kenya map with transaction density by county
Section 2.4: Channel Performance (Live) - Channel performance table
Section 2.5: Live Login Stream - Login activity table
Section 2.6: Fraud Alerts Feed - Fraud alert stream
Section 2.7: API Latency & Status - API status cards
Section 2.8: System Events Log - System events
Section 2.9: Session Monitor - Active sessions
