Hmm, but "blend of red and green in buttons" — having green primary + red danger + silver neutral satisfies it. And I'll add .btn-pm-accent with a red→green gradient for the one hero-level CTA ("Send broadcast"? no). Let me use the gradient blend on the hero's "Refresh/Export"? Better: use it on the sidebar active indicator and hero rule only. Keep buttons clean.

